<title>USA: LaserVision buys Minneapolis practice.</title>
<headline>LaserVision buys Minneapolis practice.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>LaserVision Centers Inc said Thursday it completed a Refractive Management Services Organization (RMSO) agreeement with Lindstrom, Samuelson &amp; Hardten Opthalmology Asociates PA of Minneapolis.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, LaserVision purchased the refractive surgery assets of the practice and entered into a management services agreement with the practice. Terms were not given.</p>
<p>The agreement is the company's first contract under a newly established RMSO program, which is expected to help better position LaserVision for the anticipated entry of managed care into the refractive surgery market.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
